                   
           ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮           
           │                                                                            │           
           │  󰋼 Keyboard shortcuts                                                      │           
           │  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │           
           │    ── Current context ──────────────────────────                           │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Play selected track                                     │           
           │    ❮/❯             Search  (s: artist  a: album  t: title  f: format)      │           
           │    ❮a❯             Add to a playlist                                       │           
           │    ❮i❯             Track info                                              │           
           │    ❮1❯             Show tracks view                                        │           
           │    ❮2❯             Show albums view                                        │           
           │    ❮3❯             Show artists view                                       │           
           │    ❮,❯             Settings  (music dir · p2chip options)                  │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    ── Global ────────────────────────────────                              │           
           │    ❮Esc❯           Cancel / close                                          │           
           │    ❮Ctrl+C❯        Quit immediately                                        │           
           │    ❮q❯             Quit                                                    │           
           │    ❮Space❯         Pause / Resume                                          │           
           │    ❮n❯             Next track                                              │           
           │    ❮p❯             Previous track                                          │           
           │    ❮<❯             Seek −5s                                                │           
           │    ❮>❯             Seek +5s                                                │           
           │    ❮+ / =❯         Volume up                                               │           
           │    ❮-❯             Volume down                                             │           
           │    ❮m❯             Cycle play mode                                         │           
           │    ❮b❯             Toggle 8-bit chip mode  (converts + crossfades)         │           
           │    ❮r❯             Lo-Fi lower sample rate                                 │           
           │    ❮R❯             Lo-Fi raise sample rate                                 │           
           │    ❮4❯             Open play queue                                         │           
           │    ❮f❯             Toggle fullscreen                                       │           
           │    ❮l❯             Toggle lyrics / player panel                            │           
           │    ❮\❯             Collapse / expand right panel                           │           
           │    ❮Tab❯           Switch tab                                              │           
           │    ❮?❯             This help                                               │           
           │    ❮Ctrl+R❯        Reload library                                          │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    ── Track list ────────────────────────────                              │           
           │    ❮j / ↓❯         Move down                                               │           
           │    ❮k / ↑❯         Move up                                                 │           
           │    ❮g❯             Top                                                     │           
           │    ❮G❯             Bottom                                                  │           
           │    ❮PgDn / Ctrl+D❯  Page down                                              │           
           │    ❮PgUp / Ctrl+U❯  Page up                                                │           
           │    ❮c❯             Jump to playing track                                   │           
           │    ❮[❯             Lyrics earlier (0.5s)                                   │           
           │    ❮]❯             Lyrics later (0.5s)                                     │           
           │    ❮L❯             Toggle like / Favorites                                 │           
           │    ❮e❯             Add to queue tail                                       │           
           │    ❮E❯             Play next                                               │           
           │    ❮Esc❯           Back                                                    │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Open group                                              │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    ── Playlists ─────────────────────────────                              │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Open playlist                                           │           
           │    ❮N❯             New playlist                                            │           
           │    ❮F2❯            Rename playlist                                         │           
           │    ❮d❯             Delete playlist                                         │           
           │    ❮Esc❯           Back to playlist list                                   │           
           │    ❮a❯             Add or remove track                                     │           
           │    ❮x❯             Remove track                                            │           
           │    ❮u❯             Undo remove  (5 seconds)                                │           
           │    ❮J❯             Move track down                                         │           
           │    ❮K❯             Move track up                                           │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Confirm                                                 │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Create playlist and add the track                       │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    ── Media Keys ────────────────────────────                              │           
           │    ❮F7❯            Play / Pause (media key mapping)                        │           
           │    ❮F8❯            Stop (media key mapping)                                │           
           │    ❮F9❯            Next track (media key mapping)                          │           
           │    ❮F6❯            Previous track (media key mapping)                      │           
           │    ❮F11❯           Volume down (media key mapping)                         │           
           │    ❮F12❯           Volume up (media key mapping)                           │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    ❮↑/↓❯ Scroll  ❮?❯ Close  ❮Esc❯ Cancel                                   │           
           │    Close this panel                                                        │           
           │                                                                            │           
           ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯           
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    